00:27:52.000 --> 00:28:27.000
And that's something that we have to recognize. Again, going back to the beginning of our conversation, everything is getting, businesses are getting more sophisticated at getting us to spend our money faster. A minute ago, you talked about how we give our employers a 0% interest loan. And that got me thinking about years ago, I had a tax accountant who spent every New Year's day doing his own income taxes because he wanted to get his refund as soon as possible.

37
00:28:27.000 --> 00:28:56.000
And yet we know most people, even those who are going to get refunds, wait until the last minute to do their taxes. You've advocated for moving tax day from April 15th to March 15th. Why do you think that would help? So what we see is a U-shaped pattern. So we see millions of people like her tax accountant who, when they expect a large tax refund, they're waiting for that W-2 to come as quickly as possible,

