Oh, man. Completely. I got you. I know. I'm sort of thinking, you know what, I'm going to. here's what I'll say. Every major life moment, whether it's getting divorce, getting married, going to see a mental health professional, money is always in the background. You have to pay for it somehow.

43
00:32:12.000 --> 00:33:00.000
